{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40023","headline":"郡侯坐上观琉璃瓶中游鱼 · 徐夤","name":"郡侯坐上观琉璃瓶中游鱼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宝器一泓银汉水，锦鳞才动即先知。\n似涵明月波宁隔，欲上轻冰律未移。\n薄雾罩来分咫尺，碧绡笼处较毫厘。\n文翁未得沈香饵，拟置金盘召左慈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40023.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40023","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}